I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:53.720
I am an alien! I have come to conquer Earth!

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.240
Prepare yourselves, Earthlings!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.530
Prepare yourselves!

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.540
I wish we could escape reality.

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:03.310
The heat just doesn't let up.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:06.480
Why'd the AC have to break on a day like this?

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:09.210
Maybe we could watch something cool on TV?

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:10.470
I suppose.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:16.970
And now, please enjoy Mustachio Jirou's legendary gag!

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.520
Oh no! They came off!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.290
Man, that gag is so old.

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.430
I do feel a tiny bit cooler, though.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.020
Mustachio Jirou... Mustachio Jirou is so funny!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.220
You're laughing at that gag in this day and age?

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:37.470
That's our Ran.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:40.440
Here you go, thanks for waiting!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:44.300
To combat the summer heat, you need Su's Stamina Juice.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.670
Hey, Su!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:50.360
It's gross!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.470
What <i>is</i> this?

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.060
Well!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:03:05.970
Minced Garlic, Pickled Plum, Minced Ginger, Garam Masala, Ginseng, Other {small text:} various

00:02:52.200 --> 00:03:05.970
Su's Special Stamina Juice

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.260
These are the ingredients in the juice.

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:01.080
It's like I can see a peaceful world on the horizon.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.000
Amu-chan, stay with us!

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.560
Her soul is...

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.810
I-It was supposed to be delicious!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.880
It's from Rima.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.930
"Going to doughnut shop at 4 PM."

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:16.720
What?

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.750
I think it's our turn to...

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.560
About to upchuck our souls

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:25.550
Episode 46
The Advent of Rima!? Goddess of Comedy!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.160
What are these tickets for?

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.060
I won them.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.910
Yeah! Rima sent in like a million postcards!

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.600
A million?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.890
Win the prize! Guffaw Grand Stage!!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.970
N-No!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.550
I just... I just happened to win!

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:45.800
What is the Guffaw Grand Stage?

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.970
It's a giant gathering of all different kinds of comedy acts!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.470
Rima always watches it on TV and busts a gut laughing!

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.450
It's filmed in front of a live audience.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.920
And since amateurs can participate, it's open to everyone.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:02.040
"Welcome, Amateurs!" is the name of the auditions you can watch.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:04.680
It's gonna be super fun!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.490
Comedy, huh?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.560
I'm not really all that interested, though.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.210
Are you scoffing at comedy?!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.050
Of course not! I'd never!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.600
In fact, I love it!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.560
Thank goodness. It's the day after tomorrow.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.060
Sure.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.540
Ah, it's still so hot.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.040
I hope it cools down soon.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.080
Yeah.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.270
Roar, roar!

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.230
Live Performance.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:33.690
King of Beasts Miyako-chan: More Love than the Savanna.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.850
A comedy act so silly I don't know where to start...

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.520
Today, I will finally eat you!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.600
Ah! Somebody save me!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:41.890
Wait!

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:43.970
That voice...

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.270
It's her!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:48.460
King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.880
So you're that there lion who's been prowlin' these savannas lately!

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.550
Stand back, it's dangerous!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.390
Right!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.630
You damned lion, try eatin' some of this!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:04.070
Now you've done it! Roar, roar!

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.470
And that's how, today, the peace of the savanna was protected once again!

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:15.470
Top of the Food Chain Miyako-chan!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.190
What is that? It's a riot!

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:20.620
It is a miracle!

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:24.070
Was that funny?

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.800
To be honest...

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.020
It sucked.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.770
You're angry?!

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.020
There's no place for a witty comeback.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.940
And if you want people to laugh, you've got to lay it all out there!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.610
R-Rima?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.400
Uh, who're you?

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.270
You have a long way to go!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.290
Uh, sure, and you are?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.160
I'm Amu and this is Rima.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.850
Howdy, I'm Kizaki Miyako.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.870
That's a comedy set, right?

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.270
You could tell?

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:03.020
I'm gonna do the Guffaw Grand Stage's "Welcome, Amateurs" audition!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.840
You are?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:05.890
You betcha.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.890
It's the first step to me realizin' my dream.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:09.820
Dream?

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:14.630
That's right, my dream! To become a comedian!

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:18.310
To stand on the stage and make the audience burst out laughin'!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.920
Take your feet-off the foot-on! {this is a rewrite/repun that is just as bad, if not worse, than the original: "The futon futtonda!" (the futon blew away)"}

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.140
Yeah, but with puns like that...

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.850
That's just an example!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:27.770
Ya gotta feel it! {this is a bit of a stretch from kuuki yomankai! but I think it's what is meant here}

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.770
It's when they're laughin' that people have the best smiles, ya know?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.310
Even when bad stuff happens, a funny gag can make 'em laugh and forget all about it.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.810
I wanna be a comedian and make people laugh!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.050
Oh? That's pretty cool.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.010
You don't think it's weird?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:45.850
Why would I?

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.350
Everyone thinks I just ain't right in the head.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.790
King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.160
Miyako is a bit, um, off, don't you think?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.220
No kiddin'.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.740
Stop that crazy amateur act and get to studyin'!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.180
But that doesn't really matter.

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:05.110
Yeah! It's great that you already have a dream for your future!

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:07.270
And to become a comedian, at that.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.270
It's not half bad.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.450
Ain't it, though? Comedy's the best!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:17.420
I'll help you out. The Guffaw Grand Stage is the day after tomorrow, right?

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:18.270
That's right!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.910
I came from Osaka just for this!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.770
I'm stayin' at my aunt's place right now.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:26.500
And I ain't goin' back until I pass the audition!

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:30.550
In that case, you'll need special training.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:35.400
You have that certain spark, but it is still unrefined.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.890
Training, training!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:41.020
I'll cheer you on, too! Fight, fight!

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.260
You can do it!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.970
Did I just hear something?

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.390
M-Must be your imagination.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.850
No, I definitely heard something.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:50.450
Maybe that was the comedy fairies?

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.060
There are fairies for that?

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.600
You betcha!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.700
And the legend goes...

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.930
That the comedy fairies are the companions of...

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:03.200
No, it couldn't be...

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.310
Could you really be...

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:10.220
First, allow me to demonstrate.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:17.820
Kusukusu!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.060
Ready and...

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:23.330
Bala-Balance!

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.850
T-There she goes!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:32.680
Perfectly-angled arms, the shape of her legs, and that expression on her face...

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:38.420
The legend was true! The one they say has the comedy fairies as her companions...

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.340
The legendary creature...

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.270
You are the Goddess of Comedy!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.120
Goddess of Comedy!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.080
Goddess of Comedy!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.140
Goddess of Comedy!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.160
I beg of you, train me!

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.540
My special training is quite harsh.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:52.820
I will follow you!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.390
And I'll be over there. {lol, Asa loves it. Quark rules.}

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.890
Rima's Comedy Dojo!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.560
First, 100 straight man responses!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:06.870
What the heck?! What the heck?! What the heck?!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.030
Comedy is all about timing!

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.860
Adjust your speed accordingly!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:07.750
Yes, Ma'am!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.720
Amu, you do it as well!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:10.560
Me?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.550
What the heck?! What the heck?!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.660
What the hey?

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:15.930
Your voice is too soft!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.720
Next, tongue twisters!

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.740
Bus gas explosion, bus gas explosion!

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.200
Next!

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:22.040
Bus gas explosion, bus gas explosion!

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.730
Bus gas, bus bus, gas gas.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.980
If you can't even say that, what am I supposed to do?!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.270
I'm sorry!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.930
Next, a comedic fundamental, pratfalls!

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.210
Ow!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.380
Gag or not, falling over hurts.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.060
What are you saying?

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.060
It's <i>because</i> you can overcome the pain

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:38.680
that laughter is born!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.090
My soul has been cleansed.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.920
Now, once more.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.730
Where are we?

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.350
I thought we were at the park.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.430
And finally, you must race

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.000
into that sunset!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:53.930
Right!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.100
Was there a point to that last part?

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.630
That was some pretty amazin' training.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.720
It was?!

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:12.700
Since you were able to withstand such harsh training, I've no doubt you'll pass the audition.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.230
Goddess, bless ya!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.530
Now, yell out at that sunset!

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.570
You stupid sun!

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:23.870
What's with this setup?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:27.270
All right! I'm rarin' to go make some people laugh!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:36.460
I wonder if I should change this joke a bit.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:41.870
Oh, still writing jokes? It's good that you're trying hard, but make sure you get some sleep.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.260
I will.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.930
I wonder if I'll pass the audition.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.540
No, there's nothin' to wonder, I will!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.060
I've got the Goddess of Comedy on my side!

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:56.060
Okay, let's do this!

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.760
"Welcome, Amateurs" Participants Dressing Room

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.820
Ouch! A man walked into a bar... {this is a total rewrite... the original joke is untranslatable and delivered incorrectly in the first place}

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.390
Don't give away the punchline!

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.310
This ain't good, I'm crazy jittery.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.890
Miyako!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.890
It's you guys.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.250
You look nervous.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.170
When that happens, do straight man responses!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.180
Oh, right!

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:31.140
What the heck?! What the heck?! What the heck?!

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.910
I'm not nervous anymore!

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:36.940
Everyone.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:44.210
Mustachio Jirou-sensei has come all the way here just to greet you.

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:46.850
Okay, people, do the Mustache Cheer!

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.200
What's the Mustache Cheer?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:49.930
Beats me.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.210
Mustache, mustache, mustache!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:56.770
Hey, it's Mustachio Jirou!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.760
I hope you all do your best today!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:06.370
Oh no! They came off!

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.170
There it was, the legendary gag!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:09.770
Yes, it's Mustachio Jirou!

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.130
Laugh!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:14.140
<i>Laugh.</i>

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.310
Hey, you! What are you waiting for?

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:20.600
M-Me?

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.440
That's right, you! Start clapping!

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.270
Oh, sorry. But if it were me, I'd...

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.410
You dare to criticize my gag?

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.970
What d'you think you're saying?

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.600
But I think it'd be really funny if...

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:40.100
I guess a little girl wouldn't understand my greatness. How unfortunate.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:44.220
Well then, folks, toodles!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.300
Wait for us, Sensei!

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.270
Hey, that's not good, kid.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:52.270
Mustachio Jirou's the judge today.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.190
It'll be fine!

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.520
Yeah, just do it exactly as you trained.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.890
Right.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:13.910
Hello! Thank you so very much for coming to this live recording of Guffaw Grand Stage!

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.060
Let's get this started!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.490
Welcome, Amateurs!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:22.230
Our judge for today is Mustachio Jirou-san!

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:24.020
Hello!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.610
And so, without further ado...

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.020
Welcome Amateurs!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:39.280
Who's next? This little lady's a fifth-grader in elementary school. King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.100
Come on down!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.930
It's Miyako's turn.

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:43.600
Yeah.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:45.100
You can do it, Miyako!

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.180
It's rare for us to have an elementary school student.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.520
Should be fun, don't you think, Sensei?

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:56.390
Indeed, I have high expectations of you.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:02.140
How mean, saying something like that'll just make her more nervous!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.160
Roar, roar!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.610
Somebody save me!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.890
The person who hears cries for help from far and wide...

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.890
This is where I make my entrance!

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:15.770
King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:23.140
This isn't good. She's nervous and her pace is off!

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:27.500
I will protect the peace of the savanna. Lion, prepare to-

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.390
That's quite enough.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:33.270
We don't want to see any more of this elementary school talent show.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.760
Right, everyone?

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:35.940
Exactly!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:39.180
This is not the place for you to make summer memories. {non-literal a bit}

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.680
No, I really do want to be a comedian!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:46.560
Being a comedian is a lot harder than you'd think.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.350
I know that! But I still want to be one!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.440
You're a girl, there're plenty of other things you can be.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:53.770
Like a ballerina.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.470
I wanna be a comedian!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.180
Or a baker.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.970
My dream is to make people laugh!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.770
Or get married!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.640
Becoming a comedian

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.180
is all I wanna do!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:12.080
Aren't you a strange little girl!

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:16.590
Amu!

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:17.220
Right!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.520
It was all over the moment Mustachio Jirou-sensei looked down on her.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.480
I feel sorry for her.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.630
Was she there?

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.460
No.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.680
There she is!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.180
Miyako!

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.180
An X Egg?

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.560
I know, I'm weird.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:44.350
Weird! Weird Weird. Howdy!

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:46.680
What the heck?!

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.990
Amu! Character Transform!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:51.930
Right!

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.300
My heart:

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:56.600
Unlock!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.180
My heart:

00:15:58.590 --> 00:15:59.560
Unlock!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:33.140
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.310
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.470
What the heck?!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.640
Rima!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:47.680
Got it.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.850
Juggling Party!

00:16:55.890 --> 00:17:00.060
What! The! Heck!

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.120
What the heck?! What the heck?! What the heck?!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.560
Rima!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:11.990
Are you okay?

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:12.890
I'm fine.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.890
Weird! Weird! Weird!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:16.390
It's not weird!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:22.020
Miyako shined so brightly! She was having lots of fun!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:25.770
It's when they're laughin' that people have the best smiles, ya know?

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:30.530
I wanna be a comedian and make people laugh!

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:35.720
Believe in your own dream! It doesn't matter what other people say!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:38.720
Miyako's dream is hers alone!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.430
The people who'd make fun of it are the weird ones!

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:48.020
Tightrope Dancer!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.200
Amu, now's your chance!

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:51.390
Right.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:57.600
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.890
Open Heart!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.310
King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.930
I know Miyako will make a great comedian.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:30.020
After all, her wish to make people laugh is why I was born!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.660
Thank you very much for coming! Until next time!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:41.910
What the...

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.170
Are you okay?

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:48.880
Yeah. Those bad feelings I had before are gone, and I'm feelin' fine!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:54.430
Oh no! They came off!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:57.310
Laugh!

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.410
Oh dear.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:03.920
Isn't this kind of bad?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:06.520
He doesn't have any other jokes.

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:11.890
That!

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:21.430
Enough, it'd be faster just to run!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.520
King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:30.020
Whatcha doin' lazin' around for? Do that in the savanna and you'd get yourself eaten!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.520
But this isn't the savanna.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:37.100
Say what? This is the savanna of the comedy stage!

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:40.100
It's eat or be eaten!

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:46.220
Got your mustache!

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.530
What a riot!

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:56.720
Wait, you're moved?

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.600
It was wonderful!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.940
Even though she jumped on the stage with such energy,

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:05.820
she saw the position of the mustache just as she flew over on the rope

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:07.480
and worked out how to get it!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.500
It all went according to her plan!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.730
It was?

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.720
Mustache!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:17.720
You must be joking. My gag didn't work, but that kid...

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:24.270
Your gag is definitely a once-in-a-lifetime thing.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.050
But it's old now.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.810
D-Don't say that.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:31.470
It's okay. You must simply create a new gag.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.970
But how?

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:45.020
From this day forth, you shall be Eyebrows Jirou!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:51.350
You! You're the Goddess of Comedy!

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.350
Ah, that was fun!

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.690
Did I make everyone laugh?

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.140
Yeah, a lot!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.420
Makin' people laugh is the best, all right!

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:05.210
I'm definitely gonna be a comedian!

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:10.820
And ya know, I was thinkin' of makin' a new version of King of Beasts Miyako-chan!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.140
Whatcha think?

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.110
Yes, indeed. For example...

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:21.400
I think you should make your movements more complex.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:24.060
R-Rima?

00:21:27.610 --> 00:21:29.110
What the heck were those moves?

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:30.930
You are truly the Goddess of Comedy!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:35.120
It is only a sketch, but I can sense its subtlety!

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:37.570
Let's all do it!

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:44.060
What the heck is that?

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:44.850
Beats me.

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:47.890
What if I combine it with vocals?

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.020
Good idea.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.330
All right, she laughed!

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:06.350
Now that we've made Amu laugh, let's dash into the sunset!

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:18.410
This punchline makes no sense!

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:55.390
Amu-chan's entertainment world debut has finally been set!

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:58.790
It's not like I'm interested in entertainment or anything.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.950
Like doing a concert in a dome stadium, or becoming a model and going to Paris...

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:04.850
I don't want to do it at all, okay?

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:07.050
It sure sounds like you're up for it.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.120
Hey, hey, Amu-chan... Try reading this.

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:12.650
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:12.650 --> 00:24:14.670
I'm Utau's Manager!?

00:24:14.670 --> 00:24:16.760
Me, the manager? What's that supposed to mean?

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.700
I misunderstood.

00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:19.500
No kidding.
